cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "CyTOF analysis code for: Epigenetic Heterogeneity in Breast Tumors with Implications for Disease Diagnosis and Monitoring"
abstract: >-
  Jupyter notebooks and supporting Python packages implementing the single-cell
  epigenetic CyTOF analysis reported in Furth, Riemenschneider, Arieli et al.:
  ECDF quantile batch correction, core-histone normalization, UMAP/DBSCAN
  subpopulation identification, XGBoost/SHAP classification, PermCell
  permutation-calibrated signature scoring, and Vendi diversity scoring.
authors:
  - family-names: Ron
    given-names: Guy
    affiliation: "Racah Institute of Physics, The Hebrew University of Jerusalem"
license: GPL-3.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/guyronhuji/cytof-breast-tumor-analysis"
keywords:
  - CyTOF
  - mass cytometry
  - breast cancer
  - epigenetics
  - histone modifications
  - single-cell
